        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun: Bangai Rantou-hen is the first game in the Kunio-kun series released by Technōs Japan for the Game Boy. It is a sequel to Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun, but uses the graphical style of Downtown Nekketsu Monogatari, which was previously released on the Famicom. This is the second game in the Kunio-kun series that has Kunio and Riki joining forces against a common threat, which would become a standard in later games.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun: Bangai Rantou-hen es el primer juego de la serie Kunio-kun lanzado por Technōs Japan para Game Boy. Es una secuela de Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun, pero usa el estilo gráfico de Downtown Nekketsu Monogatari, publicado antes en Famicom. Es el segundo juego de la serie Kunio-kun en el que Kunio y Riki unen fuerzas contra una amenaza común, algo que se convertiría en un estándar en los juegos posteriores.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1990",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
